{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "bb48e03e-a348-4278-a33d-3ce135f3c9eb",
    "name": "Zimal Store — Seller Onboarding (Phase 7: Seller Team)",
    "description": "Phase 7 manual test — owner / manager / staff inside one store.\n\nBEFORE YOU START\n1) php artisan migrate\n2) keep `php artisan queue:work` running (invites + audit are queued)\n3) you need an APPROVED store (its owner = {{owner_email}})\n4) you need a SECOND ordinary customer account to invite\n   ({{invitee_email}}) — Phase 7 only invites EXISTING accounts.\n\nTHE POINT OF THIS PHASE: before it, a store was one login. Sharing the\nowner's password let staff change bank details and made every audit row\nsay 'the owner did it'. Now each person has their own login and role.\n\nORDER: 0 (tokens) -> 1 (invite) -> 2 (accept as the invitee)\n       -> 3 (what each role may do) -> 4 (promote/remove) -> 5 (errors).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
